---
import PageLayout from "../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Wholesale Specialty Peptide Stacks — Pre-Formulated Research Kits",
  "description": "Factory-direct pre-formulated multi-peptide combination kits. 5 standard stacks plus custom OEM development. ≥99% HPLC purity, tiered wholesale pricing.",
  "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "name": "Peptides Source Hub", "url": "https://peptidesourcehub.com" },
};

const stacks = [
  ["Recovery Stack","BPC-157 5mg + TB-500 5mg","×10 vials each","Tissue repair synergy","Healing & recovery research"],
  ["GH Secretagogue Stack","CJC-1295 (DAC) 2mg + Ipamorelin 2mg","×10 vials each","Sustained GH pulse","Endocrine & muscle research"],
  ["Metabolic Stack","Semaglutide 5mg + Cagrilintide 5mg","×10 vials each","GLP-1 + amylin dual agonism","Metabolic pathway research"],
  ["Cosmetic Stack","GHK-Cu 50mg + Snap-8 10mg","×10 vials each","Collagen + anti-wrinkle dual action","Dermatological research"],
  ["Nootropic Stack","Semax 10mg + Selank 10mg","×10 vials each","BDNF upregulation + anxiolytic","Cognitive research"],
];

const workflow = [
  ["01","Target Design","Define multi-pathway target profile. Identify complementary mechanisms to avoid receptor competition."],
  ["02","Formulation","Determine molar ratios, salt forms, and lyophilization parameters for co-formulated vials."],
  ["03","Stability Testing","Accelerated stability study at 40°C/75% RH. Confirms no peptide-peptide degradation interactions."],
  ["04","Batch Production","GMP synthesis → HPLC purification → co-lyophilization → QC release with dual-peptide chromatogram."],
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Wholesale Specialty Peptide Stacks — Pre-Formulated Research Kits"
  description="Factory-direct pre-formulated multi-peptide combination kits. 5 standard stacks plus custom OEM development. COA with every order."
  {jsonLd}
>

<section class="section bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-light relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 hero-grid opacity-20"></div>
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 animate-on-scroll">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-sm" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
      <a href="/products/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Products</a><span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
      <span class="text-accent">Specialty Stacks</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl">Specialty Peptide Stacks</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mt-4 max-w-2xl">Pre-formulated multi-peptide combinations — ready-to-ship or custom OEM</p>
    <div class="card bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-white border-amber-200 mt-6 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Key Statistics</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">3</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Pre-Formulated Stacks</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">≥99%</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">HPLC Purity (each component)</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">1</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">COA per Stack (combined)</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">10-70%</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Bulk Discount Range</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Specialty stacks are pre-formulated combination kits that ship as a single SKU with unified batch documentation. Instead of ordering BPC-157 and TB-500 separately and coordinating two QC reports, you receive them in one kit with a single COA covering both peptides. For OEM buyers, this is the most efficient path to a branded product line — one supplier, one shipment, one set of paperwork.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">Custom stacks are fully configurable: choose your peptides, molar ratios, vial fill weights, salt forms, and packaging specifications. Standard lead time for custom stack development is 4–6 weeks including stability verification.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary group">Get a Quote <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dot-pattern">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10">Standard Stack Configurations</h2>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
      <table class="w-full text-sm bg-white">
        <thead><tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b-2 border-gray-200"><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Stack</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Contents</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-primary">Quantity</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-primary">Mechanism</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Research Use</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {stacks.map((row,i)=>(<tr class={`border-b border-gray-100 ${i%2===0?'bg-white':'bg-gray-50/50'} hover:bg-accent/5`}><td class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">{row[0]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 text-gray-600 text-sm">{row[1]}</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-accent-dark text-sm font-medium">{row[2]}</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">{row[3]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 text-gray-600 text-sm">{row[4]}</td></tr>))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4 text-center">All stacks: ≥99% purity per peptide · Individual COA per peptide included · Unified batch number</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-surface">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10">Custom Stack Development</h2>
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto stagger-children">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-8 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-accent/20 via-accent to-accent/20"></div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        {workflow.map(([num,title,desc]) => (
          <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
            <div class="hidden md:flex w-16 shrink-0 justify-center relative z-10">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent font-bold text-sm">{num}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 card p-5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="md:hidden w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent font-bold text-xs shrink-0">{num}</span>
                <h3 class="font-bold">{title}</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">{desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What are pre-formulated peptide stacks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Co-lyophilized peptide combinations in single vials. One COA, one batch number — eliminating separate reconstitution and simplifying inventory."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What stack combinations are available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cagrilintide + Semaglutide, BPC-157 + TB-500 blend, GLOW70/KLOW80 cosmetic stacks. Custom stacks for bulk orders."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What's the advantage of pre-formulated stacks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Single COA. No weighing errors. No cross-contamination. Simplified inventory (one SKU). Consistent batch ratios."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"How is stack purity verified?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each component individually verified by HPLC/MS before combination. Final stack: HPLC confirms both peaks at specified ratios. Single COA."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What is lead time for custom stacks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Standard: 5-7 business days. Custom ratio: 10-14 days. Annual contracts: priority production scheduling."}}
    ]}</script>
<h2 class="text-center mb-10">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">Can I customize the peptide ratios in a stack?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes. Standard stacks have fixed ratios (e.g., 5mg BPC-157 + 5mg TB-500), but custom ratios are available for qualifying MOQs. For example, a 10mg BPC-157 + 2.5mg TB-500 configuration is a common custom request for protocols emphasizing cytoprotection.</p></details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">Are custom stacks suitable for OEM private-labeling?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes — this is their primary use case. A custom stack with your branding, your vial labels, your kit box, and your packaging is a complete product. We handle synthesis, formulation, filling, and documentation; you manage branding, marketing, and distribution.</p></details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">How is co-formulated stability verified?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Each custom stack undergoes accelerated stability testing: 40°C / 75% RH for 4 weeks, with HPLC purity and MS identity checks at T=0, T=2wk, T=4wk. We confirm no peptide-peptide degradation interactions (e.g., disulfide scrambling, deamidation) before releasing the stack for production.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-primary py-16 text-center">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-white text-3xl mb-4">Ready to Build Your Stack?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">Standard stacks ship within 5 business days. Custom stacks: 4–6 week development including stability verification.</p>
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary text-lg group">Request Stack Quote <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="text-center py-6 bg-surface"><a href="/products/" class="text-accent-dark font-medium hover:underline">← Back to All Categories</a></div>
</PageLayout>
